# ============================================================================
# thesis-refinery — .gitignore
#
# Principle: sources are tracked, build products are not. The only documents
# that ever get committed are small, hand-authored *inputs* (the demo thesis
# sources under examples/). Everything a build produces lands in an ignored
# `_outputs/` directory.
# ============================================================================

# ---- local baseline bookkeeping (never published) ---------------------------
# `.baseline/` holds working-tree fingerprints taken before this repository was
# extracted. It exists so the extraction can be proven non-destructive.
.baseline/

# ---- build products & caches ------------------------------------------------
_outputs/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.venv/
venv/
.env

# ---- Quarto / pandoc intermediates -----------------------------------------
.quarto/
**/index.docx
**/index.pdf
**/index.tex
**/index.aux
**/index.log
**/index.toc
**/index.out
**/index_files/

# ---- Office lock files (WPS/Word leave these behind) ------------------------
~$*
~WRL*
.~lock.*

# ---- OS noise ---------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
